    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like the \"long term savings\" part is a bit of a stretch for someone just trying to keep the lights on next month. our margins are tiny. isn't the main thing these mandates do is just drive up overhead and make it harder for us to compete with bigger companies that can actually afford the upgrades?",
